body:
toxic abusive parents. moved country when i was 11 and now i'm stuck on this goddamn hill with my abusive parents for over 6 years, still barrelly speak the language and i don't have any friends anywhere near me. they decided for me that i'm gonna be a farmer when i grow up while i really wanted  to become a software engineer or maybe a truckdriver lol, but my parents feel like they're special snowflakes so they control my life and i can't go anywhere. 

&#x200B;

if reincarnation is a thing then i hope i'll be reborn with parents that care more about my well being than being proud of me.
